@AdminPortal.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5245

### Health check
GET {{AdminPortal.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### List departments
GET {{AdminPortal.Api_HostAddress}}/api/departments
Accept: application/json

### Create a department
POST {{AdminPortal.Api_HostAddress}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Engineering",
  "description": "Builds and maintains the product"
}

### List employees (paged, filterable)
GET {{AdminPortal.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Search employees by name/email
GET {{AdminPortal.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees?search=jane
Accept: application/json

### Create an employee
POST {{AdminPortal.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+27821234567",
  "hireDate": "2026-01-15T00:00:00Z",
  "salary": 45000,
  "departmentId": 1
}

###
